%% Proposed AG-UI lifecycle. Block payload kinds are namespaced CUSTOM data.
sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as AG-UI client and React reducer
  participant API as Python AG-UI answer service
  participant TOOLS as Exact tools and evidence
  participant MODEL as Gemma via OpenRouter
  UI->>API: Start run with trusted user and request ID
  API-->>UI: RUN_STARTED and safe progress events
  API->>TOOLS: Read one dataset and knowledge revision
  TOOLS-->>API: Immutable ResultSets and EvidenceRefs
  API->>MODEL: Small result receipts and view catalog
  MODEL-->>API: JSON view plan and claim references
  API->>API: Validate structure, columns, claims and references
  API-->>UI: CUSTOM block_validated with stable IDs and revisions
  API-->>UI: More CUSTOM validated blocks for same message
  API-->>UI: CUSTOM answer_complete then RUN_FINISHED
  UI->>API: Reconnect with last event cursor
  API-->>UI: Authorized snapshot or replay after cursor
  Note over UI,API: Duplicate events are idempotent; EOF without terminal event is interrupted
